{
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the model picker. The server serves this via",
    "/api/config and the client imports the same file as its offline fallback,",
    "so the two lists cannot drift apart.",
    "",
    "`tiers` is what the UI actually exposes. The Operator picks a level (1-3);",
    "the model id and effort flag behind it are an implementation detail and are",
    "deliberately not rendered anywhere in the interface. `models` below stays as",
    "the resolution table and the record of what was probed.",
    "",
    "`status` is not copied from the SDK enum - every id below was probed",
    "against the installed `claude` CLI on 2026-08-18 and recorded as it",
    "actually behaved:",
    "  ready     - CLI returned a completion",
    "  credits   - valid id, refused with 'out of usage credits' on this plan",
    "  no-access - CLI rejected the id outright",
    "",
    "Pricing/context are filled in only where verified. Null means unknown,",
    "and the UI renders nothing rather than guessing."
  ],
  "defaultModel": "claude-opus-5",
